stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Constructed: Construct / query capabilities / create nav + target + tasks
    Constructed --> Reset: ResetInternals
    Reset --> Thinking: policy task eligible
    Thinking --> Paused: simulation paused or race ending
    Paused --> Thinking: execution resumes
    Thinking --> Tracking: update target + roads + collision state
    Tracking --> Choosing: update subtype and goal
    Choosing --> Choosing: scan non-current eligible actions
    Choosing --> Transition: later candidate score >= current score
    Transition --> Acting: old.Finish then new.Begin
    Choosing --> Acting: keep current
    Acting --> Latched: action.Update writes target/speed/flags or direct controls
    Latched --> Simulating: OnTaskSimulate
    Simulating --> Thinking: apply common steering/longitudinal outputs
    Acting --> SimplePhysics: off-world/simple mode
    SimplePhysics --> Thinking: advance pose and road elevation directly
    Thinking --> Unspawned: unspawn request / terminal helicopter exit
    Unspawned --> Reset: respawn/spawn
    Reset --> [*]: behavior destroyed

    note right of Choosing
        Current action is excluded.
        Finished current permits replacement.
        Equal scores choose the later eligible action.
    end note

    note right of Latched
        flags: steer=1, longitudinal=2,
        reverse allowance=4
    end note
